        "original_id": "e70ee228-e65f-5e32-9a52-2843564363bd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Selina Giles, Jean-Claude Van Damme, Stephen Rea, James McTeigue, The Wachowskis, Alan Moore, David Lloyd, Mordecai Richler, David Julian Hirsh, Elliott Gould, Andrea Martin\n- Works: Until Death, V for Vendetta, V for Vendetta (film), St. Urbain's Horseman, St. Urbain's Horseman (TV series)\n- Topics: film adaptations, television series casting\n\nFacts:\n- The 1988 DC/Vertigo Comics limited series \"V for Vendetta\" was created by Alan Moore and David Lloyd.\n- The 2005 film \"V for Vendetta\" is a dystopian political thriller directed by James McTeigue and written by The Wachowskis.\n- The 2005 film \"V for Vendetta\" was based on the 1988 DC/Vertigo Comics limited series of the same name.\n- Selina Giles is known for playing Valerie Stowe in \"Until Death\" with Jean-Claude Van Damme and Stephen Rea.\n- Selina Giles is also known for playing Evey's mother in the Wachowskis' film \"V for Vendetta.\"\n- The TV series \"St. Urbain's Horseman\" was based on the novel by Mordecai Richler.\n- The TV series \"St. Urbain's Horseman\" starred David Julian Hirsh, Selina Giles, Elliott Gould, and Andrea Martin.",
